@startuml
actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Nexo API" as API
Admin -> UI: Submit member email
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /organizations/{organizationId}/invitations (InviteMemberDto)
activate API
API --> UI: 201 Created (AccountDto, status: Invited) or 400/403/409
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Show result
deactivate UI
@enduml
